// BT-5177: a typed caller of `asJson` on a JsonMappable class. Returning the
// answer directly as `-> Dictionary` only type-checks when `JsonMappable asJson`
// answers Dictionary, so adopters need no `asJson -> Dictionary` override.

Object subclass: JsonMappedTypedCaller

  class encode: usage :: JsonMappedTokenUsage -> Dictionary => usage asJson
